WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.210
Act 1, Scene 2.

2
00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:05.870
A crowned figure gives a
smooth speech to his court.

3
00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:11.170
Above it float balanced scales, and
wedding bells beside funeral bells.

4
00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.210
Later the room empties.

5
00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:15.690
The same king kneels alone.

6
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.800
"O, my offence is rank, it
smells to heaven;" Behind him,

7
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:24.350
a second figure draws
a sword, and hesitates.

8
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.970
A murderer on his knees,
praying for forgiveness.

9
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.630
Is he a monster?

10
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:34.310
In this mission, you'll take apart the
new king's polished public rhetoric.

11
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.010
You'll hear his private confession, alone,

12
00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:38.400
in Act 3.

13
00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:41.960
And you'll ask what the queen
beside him really knows.

14
00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:45.650
Your mission: decide whether
Claudius is a monster.
